  "unitName": "2. Scanning Networks",
  "unitDescription": "This unit teaches network scanning as a controlled, evidence-driven extension of reconnaissance. Players work inside an authorized Asterlink Transit scan window, interpret host discovery, ports, banners, packet behavior, IPv4 and IPv6 exposure, firewall responses, and final remediation evidence without exploiting the target.",
  "defaultPlayerName": "Alex",
  "unitEntryMessage": "Welcome back, {player}. Asterlink Transit is hours from launching a night-service ticketing and station-signage network. Dr. Mira Sen has authorized a narrow scan window. Your job is to build an accurate map, explain ECHO-73, and keep the scan useful without crossing scope.",
